    "detailed_description": "\ud83d\udcdc<strong>STORY</strong>  <br><br>A Girl Who Wakes Up One Day Charlotte feels that she has forgotten something precious and she decides to go on a journey to find something. Journey with Charlotte and find the pieces of her forgotten memories!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/5e0254f58e2a9c5daa3bbd8ea3a6dfe5.avif?t=1707563321\" data-has-big width=800 height=635 /></span><br><br> \ud83d\udcfd\ufe0f<strong>INGAME</strong><br><br>- Create a save slot on the start screen and play it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/53e27f7ec2d69f210afeef96730e50f0.poster.avif?t=1707563321\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/53e27f7ec2d69f210afeef96730e50f0.webm?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/53e27f7ec2d69f210afeef96730e50f0.mp4?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>- Feel free to explore the stages by choosing the stage you want to explore from the stage selection screen (If the portal is lit, please clear the previous stage first)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/973d3b0106e35c9a0d18efa532609ac7.poster.avif?t=1707563321\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/973d3b0106e35c9a0d18efa532609ac7.webm?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/973d3b0106e35c9a0d18efa532609ac7.mp4?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Explore each stage and acquire hidden puzzle items using direction keys and jumps<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a3576e76d1272aaa979bd2f366bdb28f.poster.avif?t=1707563321\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a3576e76d1272aaa979bd2f366bdb28f.webm?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a3576e76d1272aaa979bd2f366bdb28f.mp4?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/da4e73028d0e7bef97098feb26c377b7.poster.avif?t=1707563321\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/da4e73028d0e7bef97098feb26c377b7.webm?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/da4e73028d0e7bef97098feb26c377b7.mp4?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a4dd2d5f13535514f48c16d7a3f4f36f.poster.avif?t=1707563321\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a4dd2d5f13535514f48c16d7a3f4f36f.webm?t=1707563321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743860/extras/a4dd2d5f13535514f48c16d7a3f4f36f.mp4?t=1707563321\" type=\"vi